	(text "In case you actually need to make this:\nATMEGA328P HAS DIFFERENT PINOUT IN DIP AND TQFP PACKAGE!!!!\n\nFor Pump It Up LX, you do not need the RS232 IC,\nJust tie PD0 (pin30) to 5V through a pull up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 234.696 112.268 0)
